[
  {
    "id": "patterns-against-distance",
    "title": "Patterns Against Distance",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "three bodies suspended",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in arrangements older than language",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and somehow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I still thought they meant something",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I kept drawing lines between them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though the universe",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "had placed them there for me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe alignment is only visible",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "from one precise place,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "at one precise moment",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "before everything drifts apart again",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I see you now",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "though maybe not tomorrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "this year,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but maybe not the next",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "our lives crossing briefly",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "until somewhere further ahead—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "time pulls us back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "into the same line again",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "in the impossible geometry",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of being alive at once",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "here we are",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "aligned",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in time,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in space",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#patterns-against-distance"
  },
  {
    "id": "polaroids",
    "title": "Polaroids",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "polaroids",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i hang them on my wall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i look at each of them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and wonder",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "if i could travel through them all",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "as if every photograph",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "were somewhere",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could still return to",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "sometimes i wish",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could grow tired of these memories",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but memories always have a way",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of coming back to me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“i’ll be back soon,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“pinky promise,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i’ll come back one day",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "maybe i won’t",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i keep going back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just to live a little longer",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in the way things used to be",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "even when they cannot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "come back to me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#polaroids"
  },
  {
    "id": "i-miss",
    "title": "I miss",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the sunsets",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when the clouds appeared their prettiest",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "warm colours bleeding into one another",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how they gave me emotions",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and memories of a home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the smell",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of honey and lavender",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on walks with my sister",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "past the houses of neighbours",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "whose streets i still remember",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss walking home from school",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with the friends i loved most",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the one friend",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "who carried all the things",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i was too afraid",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to carry alone",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the friends i made",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just before leaving",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how cruel it was",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "a hello could arrive late,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with goodbye already",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "waiting at the door",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss how slowly the days passed",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how quickly the years went by",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the times i had them all,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#i-miss",
    "sourceImage": {
      "src": "/images/poetry/i-miss.jpeg",
      "alt": "Clouds over a quiet intersection at sunset."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "the-stars-do-not-know",
    "title": "The stars do not know",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "we’ve heard about the stars.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "we’ve even named them.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but the stars don’t know us—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t know me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t even know my name.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i guess then, that means",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i cannot exist without the stars,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but the stars continue to exist",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "without me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-stars-do-not-know"
  },
  {
    "id": "i-wandered-through-the-sea",
    "title": "I Wandered Through the Sea",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "I wandered through the sea,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the sun waylaying",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "at the edge of the world,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as it said goodnight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and laid its head to sleep.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I journeyed through the waves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as the moon lit up the path,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as if it knew",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the voyage I had taken on,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and where I’d be drawn",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "With fragments of the sun",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "so gently borrowed,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "half her face, innocent",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and almost sly,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "hid behind",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the blue earth’s shadow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I glimmered through the waters,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though I moved in quiet accord",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "from dear Titan Selene",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for meek and gentle tides.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Soon I became unaware",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of the path I was taking,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "lost in that monochrome",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of blue, grey, and black",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Slowly, I was taken in",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the beauty",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of those vast blue sheets,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the glimmers of moonlight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the stars that danced",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on the sharp crests of the waves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I wandered through the sea",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "until I had gone so far",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that I became a tiny creature",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "meaningless,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "yet somehow meaningful",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "held among the rise and fall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of waves in their obedience",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to the moon.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#i-wandered-through-the-sea"
  },
  {
    "id": "the-space-between-us",
    "title": "The Space Between Us",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "returning to a home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "distant yet so close",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "seeing you",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "is like viewing planets through a telescope",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe through all this chaos and confusion",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "brought down to us",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on this tiny",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "pale",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "blue",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "dot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "suspended in a sunbeam",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "we can overcome many things,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "travel through planets",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and whatever lies beyond",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "as I gaze upon billions of years",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of collapsing and re-emerging stars",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I will find peace and serenity",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in your eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "concentrated in you.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-space-between-us",
    "sourceImage": {
      "src": "/images/poetry/the-space-between-us-moon.png",
      "alt": "A crescent moon over a waterfront at dusk."
    }
  }
]
